     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Severe hypotension (MAP < 70 mm Hg): vasopressors to a target SBP of 80 to 90 mm Hg (not > 110); norepinephrine = first-line vasopressor (Surviving Sepsis guidelines)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
